        "original_id": "c5890bf0-8f6b-5c77-af48-b6b826bd73e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bertha Gilkey\n- Places: St. Louis, Missouri\n- Organizations: tenant management association\n- Projects: Cochran Gardens public housing project\n- Concepts: property management\n\nFacts:\n- Property management is the operation, control, and oversight of real estate in its broadest sense.\n- Bertha Gilkey established the first tenant management association in St. Louis, Missouri.\n- The tenant management association successfully rehabilitated the previously decrepit Cochran Gardens public housing project.\n- Bertha Gilkey managed the Cochran Gardens public housing project for more than 20 years.",
